flowchart TB
    U[User or authenticated trigger] --> S[Session supervisor]
    S --> W[Generic Deep Agents worker]
    W --> J[QuickJS eval and external working state]
    J -->|libraryOpen and libraryRead| G[Skill graph and context service]
    J -->|native task bridge| C[Supervised compiled worker]
    C -->|same invocation contract| S
    J -->|librarySubmit| D[Immutable candidate]
    D --> R{Required review policies}
    R -->|critic calls| S
    R -->|findings and remaining budget| W
    R -->|all checks passed| A[Accepted artifact and receipt]
    R -->|limit or unavailable evidence| N[Needs review]
    S --- B[Shared admission ledger and capabilities]
    A --> G
    A --> M[Observation proposals]
    M --> O[Authorized maintenance session]
    O --> K[Versioned memory notes and skill proposals]
    K --> G
